                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource BaseText}" Foreground="{DynamicResource ForegroundMutedBrush}" Margin="8,0,0,12" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                                        New service: LibraryCacheService. Three-tier scan
                                        architecture: (1) in-memory session, (2) persistent
                                        JSON cache, (3) full TagLib# read — fallback only.
                                        Cache key: FilePath + FileSizeBytes + LastWriteTimeUtc.
                                        Cache hit skips TagLib# entirely. A 2,483-file library
                                        with nothing changed: first scan ~2 min, subsequent
                                        scans under 3 seconds. Cache stored in app folder as
                                        library_cache_[8-char folder hash].json — one file per
                                        library folder, safe across path changes.
                                        Artwork is never cached (prevents 75–370 MB files).
                                        Covers still load via the ReadMetadata full read on scan.
                                        Ghost cleanup: paths no longer on disk are evicted from
                                        the cache on every save — no stale entries accumulate.
                                        Cache auto-invalidates: modified files (size or mtime
                                        changed) are always re-read from disk. Schema version
                                        field — bumping forces a full rebuild on app updates.
                                        SyncLibraryEntry now refreshes the cache entry after
                                        embed — so the next scan sees the updated metadata.
                                        Settings tab: new ⚡ Library Scan Cache GroupBox shows
                                        entry count and a Clear Cache button.
                                        Scan status line shows cache vs disk breakdown:
                                        "✓ 2483 file(s) — 2483 from cache, 0 read from disk."
                                        Build 56: Settings display fix — SavedCopyDestination
                                        and SavedConflictMode proxy properties replace direct
                                        Settings.Last* bindings (plain POCO, never notified).
